From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.networking.connectivity: GetProxyConfigurationAsync and GetSortedEndpointPairs (3668)

windows.networking.connectivity: GetProxyConfigurationAsync, GetSortedEndpointPairs

NetworkInformation.GetProxyConfigurationAsync answers from the user's Internet
Settings (per-scheme proxy list, bypass list with <local> and wildcards, PAC
URL or auto-detect through WinHTTP): ProxyConfiguration with ProxyUris and
CanConnectDirectly. GetSortedEndpointPairs orders EndpointPairs by the RFC 6724
destination address selection rules, with the source address taken from the
host's routing; names rank after addresses, ties keep the input order.
---
